        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average technology for the production of soap out of a blend of fatty acids from palm and coconut oil, representing typical European production mix in the mid 90s. The ratio of short to long fatty acid chains is 20:80, the moisture 13%.\n\n# Included processes\nThis module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of soap out of fatty acids from palm and coconut oil. Transports and infrastructure have been estimated. No water consumption included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
